    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "It was a small Iberian town, one that you can't even find on a map or in history books.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "When people still lived there, it was called Rocamarea.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "The Bishop of Rocamarea raised a young Sankta. A Sankta... growing up here, learning here, and enjoying life to the fullest.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "This was a humble and barren place, but well suited for the asceticism of a pious life.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Except after the Profound Silence, life in Iberia was always fragile, no matter how hard people worked.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "One plague, one famine, or one premeditated infiltration was all it took to bring everything crashing down.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "To save the hometown that, at the same time, was not his hometown, the Sankta arrived in the holy city of Laterano to ask for any amount of support.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "The answer he received was simple: You are one of us, but they are not.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "When the Sankta returned to Iberia, that 'hometown' had disappeared.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Everything had been completely smoothed over, erased, as if it never existed at all.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Like a grain of sand disappearing into the desert, or a drop of water dissolving into the tide.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "After a long journey, the Sankta returned to Laterano an emaciated, lost soul.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "He went to the chapel to seek a canonized bishop, in search of answers or guidance.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "But even the canonist could only remain silent in the face of such great doubt.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "On the pew he sat, remaining there from dawn to dusk.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Fiammetta, that was the first time I met Andoain.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
