    },
    {
        "text": "Sigh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget it, I'll pay for it myself. The repairs here cost too much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll just have to cut back on the afternoon tea and sweets.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Holiness! I heard the sound of fighting coming from the Basilica! Are you alright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Apostolic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What... You were attacked by heretics?! I'm sorry! I failed in my duties!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Apostolic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fret not, Paolario. Did you forget who won the Basilica's last arm wrestling tournament?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Apostolic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was just exercising my wrist a bit, and ended up causing a bit of an accident.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The unrest within the city has already subsided.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, they've dispersed. I didn't even get a chance to grill\u2013\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Apostolic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Excuse me, can I come in?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_358_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahem, my apologies. Your Holiness, I'm making a fool of myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Apostolic Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "What I meant was, the ones you asked for are here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Apostolic Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please come in, my children.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Salutations, Your Holiness...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good day, Your Holiness. I am Cecelia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, welcome. You'll have to forgive me for the mess here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for you two...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What sweets do you like with tea?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
