    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness02_intro",
        "key": "$darkness02_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I often think back to what happened that night.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "At first, it was just an ordinary cleanup mission, just another group of Sarkaz raiders.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "We tracked them down as they made their escape, and came upon the place.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Unusual, but there were no signs of hostility.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Only... traces of those men locked in their own time.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I received that emergency request for aid... I left you.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I abandoned you.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "The distress signal wasn't from very far away. The round trip would be half a day at most.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I even rushed back early...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "26_i16",
        "xScale": 1,
        "yScale": 1,
        "x": -30
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xScaleTo": 0.8,
        "yScaleTo": 0.8,
        "xTo": 0,
        "duration": 40,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.5,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I remember the mottled texture of the tiles under my feet. I remember the sensation of cold rain falling on my face.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I remember your black horns. And your tightly closed eyes.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "And Andoain, who had gone missing.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "But... it was just a cleanup mission.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "It was just another cleanup mission!!!",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Why did it have to happen like that? Where did it all go wrong?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "If I had never left... If I had stayed there, if I had been with you, would none of that have happened?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "At least... At least it wouldn't have been...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "That by the time I arrived, everything was set in stone. It couldn't be undone.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "It's an awful feeling. Truly, unbearably awful.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "That the only thing I could do was watch...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I should've been there to shoulder the burden alongside all of you.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "26_g10_laterano_roof",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$batmeeting_intro",
        "key": "$batmeeting_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_213_mostma_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not true, Fiammetta. You don't have to shoulder anyone's burden.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, that is my choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't care what power he was lusting after, what secrets he was trying to uncover, what answers he was trying to find.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't care about his ideals, his lofty cause, who he redeemed, or who he guided.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will not forgive him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not because of my beliefs, not because of Laterano, not because of the Pontifica Cohors, and not even the time that I've lost...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will not forgive him, because\u2013\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Andoain, you betrayed the people who trusted you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "My old friends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "How come you're here in one piece?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How come even His Holiness can't...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How come...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "How come... you're asking me that again... The path was never there in the first place. What good does it do groping around in the nothingness?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_213_mostma_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this your penitence?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Penitence? No, I have nothing to repent... Where can I repent? There is no light, no path. Those who suffer must continue to suffer, those who grieve must continue to grieve.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no salvation, no paradise. This is Laterano, and it is the only thing that belongs to us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the light has always been a lie... No, not a lie... It's real, but not as we wished...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "There has never been a light... let alone illumination...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you babbling about, Andoain?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have I given up? Why would I be here if I had given up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "With a barrier this thick, how am I supposed to embrace them? How am I supposed to embrace them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe I am nothing more than a swindler peddling false hope... who deceived myself into believing it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't understand. What is Its judgment? Where does It want me to go? Its very presence has already blocked my path...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where shall I find my path?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Andoain! Wake up! Look who's standing in front of you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who... Ahh... Fiammetta...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you losing your mind again?! Where did your honey tongue go, your righteous air? Have you lost your spine?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How am I supposed to convict a husk of a madman? Take a good look at who's standing in front of you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm in Laterano, Fiammetta. I'm above the Basilica.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm glad to see you all again... No, I'm not glad at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
