    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you trying to get in the way?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "You still dare to get in my way?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Apologize, Andoain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right now. Get on your knees and apologize to Mostima and Lemuen!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you think you did nothing wrong?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have made countless mistakes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're still pretty damned smug, aren't you?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "God forbid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen up, Andoain. I don't give a damn what your beliefs are, nor do I care if all your beliefs have gone to shit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
